# Object Property: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/mondo#part_of_progression_of_disease> (part of progression of disease)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#id> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/mondo#part_of_progression_of_disease> "part_of_progression_of_disease")
